flowchart LR
    STAFF[Staff review interface] --> API[API modular monolith]
    MEMBER[Member interface] --> API
    IDP[OIDC identity provider] --> API
    API --> DB[(PostgreSQL with FORCE RLS)]
    API --> OBJ[(Private source objects)]
    DB --> RELAY[Transactional outbox relay]
    RELAY --> QUEUE[At-least-once queue]
    QUEUE --> WORKER[Worker using shared domain modules]
    WORKER --> DB
    WORKER --> AI[AI draft adapter with no approval authority]
    WORKER --> PROVIDER[Email and SMS adapters]
    PROVIDER --> CALLBACK[Verified callbacks and reconciliation]
    CALLBACK --> API
    API --> OBS[Redacted telemetry and restricted audit]
    WORKER --> OBS
